Updating a key preserves all untouched frontmatter keys and the markdown body.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Demo
type: feature
status: backlog
sp: 5
---
# Demo Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Demo
 type: feature
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
 sp: 5
 ---
 # Demo Plan
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Demo
type: feature
status: in-progress
sp: 5
---
# Demo Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
